# Terraform — never commit provider binaries or state (OAP has a 766MB .terraform/ committed)
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log
*.tfvars
!example.tfvars

# Node
node_modules/

# Local
.DS_Store
*.log

# Real config values — only *.example.* templates are committed.
# NOTE: these are PATH-SPECIFIC on purpose. A blanket `values.yaml` rule would
# also ignore Helm chart values files, which MUST be committed for ArgoCD to
# read them from git. Only the user-supplied override files are ignored here.
terraform.tfvars
infrastructure/terraform/terraform.tfvars
infrastructure/gitops/values.yaml
examples/dark-factory-kata/values.yaml
examples/dark-factory-lambda/values.yaml
tfplan
